# BUGS

The Index can't be searched; it is one long list.
A page is shown as text in the theme's code style, its headings and lists as man(1) prints them, not in the theme's own styles.
A link to a page the manual hasn't goes nowhere and says nothing.
The plumber doesn't start guide: a page plumbed before guide runs is refused.
